        <mxCell id="step-9" value="9" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1490" y="1040" width="28" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-bg" value="" style="verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;shape=mxgraph.basic.rect;fillColor2=none;strokeWidth=1;size=20;indent=5;fillColor=light-dark(#EDF3FF,#305363);strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1750" y="30" width="620" height="1140" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-container" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry height="1100" width="580" x="1770" y="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-heading" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;데이터 흐름 단계&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=18;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="580" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-1-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry height="93" width="580" x="0" y="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-1-badge-legend" value="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="step-1-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-1-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;앱·데이터 전달&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;관객 폰과 발표자 노트북이 CloudFront에서 앱(MediaPipe wasm·제스처 모델·마커·해설 mp3)과 data/{YYYYMM}/{구}.json·index.json을 받음. 사이트 버킷은 비공개(OAC), 403/404 → index.html, no-cache.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-1-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="528" height="93" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-2-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry height="74" width="580" x="0" y="145" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-2-badge-legend" value="2" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="step-2-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-2-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;발표자 상태 발행&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;호스트 #/host·무대 #/stage가 AppSync Events(API 키, 네임스페이스 seoul)의 /seoul/state·/seoul/stage에 월·구·지표·무대 상태를 발행.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-2-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="528" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry height="74" width="580" x="0" y="231" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-badge-legend" value="3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="step-3-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;관객 폰이 따라옴&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;폰(#/ar·#/3d)과 큰 화면 #/3d?stage=1이 WebSocket으로 구독해 1초 안에 같은 장면으로 바뀜.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-3-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="528" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry height="112" width="580" x="0" y="317" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-badge-legend" value="4" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="step-4-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;월 가져오기 요청&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;호스트 &quot;월 가져오기&quot; → CloudFront /api/fetch-month → Function URL(AWS_IAM, OAC·SigV4) → API Lambda가 발표자 암호(SSM)와 IP별 잠금(인증 상태 버킷, Secrets Manager HMAC 키)을 검사하고 작업 기록을 쓴 뒤 202.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-4-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="528" height="112" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-5-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry height="74" width="580" x="0" y="441" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-5-badge-legend" value="5" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="step-5-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-5-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Worker 비동기 호출&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;API Lambda가 Worker를 InvocationType=Event로 호출(잠금 lock.json, 진행 중이면 409).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-5-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="528" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-6-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry height="112" width="580" x="0" y="527" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-6-badge-legend" value="6" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="step-6-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-6-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;수집·집계·쓰기&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;Worker가 SSM의 서울 API 키로 열린데이터광장 Open API(HTTP 8088)를 자치구별로 페이지 조회해 법정동 단위로 집계 → S3 data/* 쓰기·index.json 병합 → CloudFront 무효화 /data/*. 연 단위 fetch-year는 운영자가 직접 호출.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-6-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="528" height="112" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-7-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry height="93" width="580" x="0" y="651" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-7-badge-legend" value="7" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="step-7-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-7-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;AI 해설 생성&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;Worker가 Bedrock Converse(us.anthropic.claude-haiku-5-5)로 서울 전체+25구 26줄 해설을 만들고 검증해 data/{YYYYMM}/narration.json에 저장.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-7-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="528" height="93" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-8-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry height="74" width="580" x="0" y="756" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-8-badge-legend" value="8" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="step-8-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-8-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;진행 알림&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;Worker가 /seoul/jobs에 running·done·error를 발행 → 호스트 진행 표시 → 완료 시 index를 다시 읽어 새 달이 나타남.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-8-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="528" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-9-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry height="93" width="580" x="0" y="842" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-9-badge-legend" value="9" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="step-9-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-9-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;CDK 배포&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;cdk deploy → CloudFormation이 사이트(data/* 제외)와 데이터 시드(data/, prune 없음) BucketDeployment를 올리고, AwsCustomResource가 매 배포 Worker의 rebuild-index를 호출.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-9-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="528" height="93" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-line-styles-group" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container" connectable="0"><mxGeometry height="112" width="580" x="0" y="955" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-line-styles-bg" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#F5F5F5,#29393B);strokeColor=#666666;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-line-styles-group"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="580" height="112" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-line-styles-title" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;선 스타일&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-line-styles-group"><mxGeometry x="12" y="6" width="200" height="22" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-line-0" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;elbow=vertical;endFill=1;strokeColor=#545B64;rounded=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;startArrow=none;" edge="1" parent="legend-line-styles-group"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="16" y="42" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="96" y="42" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-line-0-text" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;런타임 요청·데이터 흐름 (화살표 = 방향, 양방향 = 발행·구독)&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-line-styles-group"><mxGeometry x="110" y="32" width="460" height="20" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-line-1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;elbow=vertical;endFill=1;strokeColor=#545B64;rounded=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;startArrow=none;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;" edge="1" parent="legend-line-styles-group"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="16" y="66" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="96" y="66" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-line-1-text" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;배포·프로비저닝 (CDK → CloudFormation → S3 · Worker)&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-line-styles-group"><mxGeometry x="110" y="56" width="460" height="20" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-line-2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;elbow=vertical;endFill=1;strokeColor=#545B64;rounded=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;startArrow=none;" edge="1" parent="legend-line-styles-group"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="16" y="90" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="96" y="90" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-line-2-text" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;선이 교차하는 곳은 아치(점프)로 표시&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-line-styles-group"><mxGeometry x="110" y="80" width="460" height="20" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
